{"about_the_game":"You are an ordinary blacksmith in an extraordinary world. While heroes fight monsters, it\u2019s you who forges their weapons.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Forge Simulator</h2>Forge swords, axes, spears, and even simple pitchforks for the locals.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916470/extras/a8b113c052f100eb9b92f8fc052e0c39.poster.avif?t=1760946082\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916470/extras/a8b113c052f100eb9b92f8fc052e0c39.webm?t=1760946082\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916470/extras/a8b113c052f100eb9b92f8fc052e0c39.mp4?t=1760946082\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Weapon Customization</h2>Every tempering, sharpening, gemstone, or rune gives the weapon unique properties.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916470/extras/8c9aa1e3d53ae339ef76962632c8977f.poster.avif?t=1760946082\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916470/extras/8c9aa1e3d53ae339ef76962632c8977f.webm?t=1760946082\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916470/extras/8c9aa1e3d53ae339ef76962632c8977f.mp4?t=1760946082\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Quests and Orders</h2>Heroes, peasants, monster hunters, and even nobles\u2014you can take orders from anyone!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916470/extras/981daef593b8ed1b86167be0869b135e.poster.avif?t=1760946082\